  ending the pass; the depth attachment in a fragment slot is left to fb_depth_rule
- pass dump names rp_flush's caller and the reason a continuation is refused or split
- DM_UE_CVAR_SET=<main off>:<f|i>=<value>,...: hold Unreal console variables

Orbitals: ~270 passes a frame, GPU 40 ms; with r.DynamicRes.MaxScreenPercentage 66 a steady 30 fps.

