 +### Indirect-draw base instance into `c0 + 0x644` on the GPU
 +
 +- **Symptom:** world props missing — café chairs and tables, planters, signs, furniture sets invisible while their NPCs collided with and sat on them (draws and collision ran, geometry never appeared).
